            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Wendy Baxter"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this as the recipe is and then a second with almond flour. Both turned out excellent! The loaves didn't last more than the weekend. Great toasted w/ butter or on its own.",
