            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cginou"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This zucchini bread was awesome. I did add more cinnamon but the fact that its half enriched white flour and the other half is whole wheat is a bonus.",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-26T18:45:01.603Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Deb C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This zucchini bread is not as sweet as other zucchini breads I have made. The nuttiness of the whole wheat flour gives the bread great flavor and texture. Out of habit, I beat the first four ingredients together very well before mixing in the zucchini, and then mixed in the entire amount of the dry ingredients. Also out of habit, I lined the bottom of the pan with parchment paper for ease in removing the bread from the pan. If you are looking for a little variation in zucchini breads, this is a nice recipe to try.",
            "datePublished": "2012-08-01T14:33:21.220Z"
          }
